 map. Prefer `MockSchemaRegistryClient` or the `mock://` pseudo-protocol for local coverage; do not require a real Schema Registry Docker service unless verification proves the mock path is insufficient.\",\n  \"risks\": [\n    \"The artifact is a base schema serializer module; concrete Avro/JSON/Protobuf serializers live in sibling artifacts, so tests should avoid depending on those unless intentionally broadening coverage.\",\n    \"Some formatter/reader classes may touch Kafka tooling APIs; focus first on schema-id serializers, subject/context strategies, wrapper serializers, and config behavior covered by transitive dependencies.\"\n  ]\n}", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_045088c69514068c016a7f7d2d036c81958c65980505f1ff15\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.5", "usage": {"input": 3731, "output": 738, "cacheRead": 38400, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 516, "totalTokens": 42869, "cost": {"input": 0.018655, "output": 0.02214, "cacheRead": 0.0192, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.05999499999999999}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1786740001031, "responseId": "resp_045088c69514068c016a7f7d215b8c8195a7d7a0461f4ef609", "rawStopReason": "completed"}, "toolResults": []}
